{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TURBOCIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Type of Party Shooter!</strong> Simple controls. Fast action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd79 What is TURBOCIDE?</strong><br> <strong>Defeat Others, chain your kills, and power up!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every elimination makes you move faster and shine brighter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up weapons on the map.</strong> No loadouts. Everyone starts equal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay on the move.</strong> Jump pads, lifts, and wide arenas keep the pace high.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your fights wisely.</strong> Small weapons for steady play. Power weapons for big moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Work together\u2026 or don\u2019t.</strong> Team Deathmatch, Free-for-All, or Capture the Core!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Killchains</strong> \u2013 The more you eliminate, the stronger you feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena Maps</strong> \u2013 Designed for fast loops, vertical fights, and exciting comebacks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Why It\u2019s Fun</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy but easy-to-control movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons that <i>feel</i> good \u2014 from precise Railguns to wild Rocket Cores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual effects and announcer calls make every killchain exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >